{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんこんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気温も30℃を超えてきて\n日が長くなって\nしっかり夏を感じる日々"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど、私は頑なにパーカーを着ています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "羽織ものが好きなんです。\nなにか羽織っとくとホッとする^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026\n福井、神奈川、北海道、広島ときて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日は大阪公演がありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "地元関西で、幼い頃から馴染みのある大阪城ホールでライブをさせていただけることが本当に幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全てに感謝しかない！\nありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、全国ツアーも後半です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早いですね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎夏、ツアーをさせていただけることが本当にありがたく嬉しい限りです。\n来てくださる方が帰り道、乃木坂のことでいっぱいになって楽しかったと思っていだだけるように、少しでもその力になれると嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mob787eap.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobv0Mcjp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobnEEqIB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobxsjEZ7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日42枚目シングルアンダー楽曲「フォルテシモ」のMVが公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "壮大でとても素敵なMVを作っていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/KZNDIhxGwoQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mob0xnwbF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVのなかで作戦会議してました^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月19日\nNHK AM「らじらー！サンデー！」\n20時台、21時台前半に出演させていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久々のスタジオ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "聞いていただけると嬉しいです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}